# Anvil vehicle fix 2/2, deterministic bake (2026-10-09). The Android 17
# image's libcutils __use_memfd() needs sys.use_memfd=1 when the kernel
# lacks the memfd_class policycap (6.7+; 6.6 SELinux predates it) — else the
# ashmem compat devnode is denied by policy and system_server dies
# ("Failed to create ashmem: Permission denied"). First-stage init copies
# this ramdisk file ("Copied ramdisk prop") and second-stage init loads it
# as a boot default BEFORE any service starts, replacing the adb setprop
# race that previously won or lost by boot timing.
sys.use_memfd=1
